<body lang=RU style='tab-interval:35.4pt;word-wrap:break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<h1><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Расписание занятий
для групп 2640 МП, 2641 МП, 2642 МП, 2643 МП, 2650 ЭП, 2651 ЭП<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<h3><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>09.11.2026 -
15.11.2026<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=2184
 style='width:1638.35pt;mso-cellspacing:0cm;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
 mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:
